Reproduction
------------

```
python scripts/fallacy_detection/align_academic_to_argumentum.py \
  --out-csv  MyIA.AI.Notebooks/GenAI/FallacyDetection/data/academic/logic_mafalda_to_argumentum.csv \
  --out-json MyIA.AI.Notebooks/GenAI/FallacyDetection/data/academic/alignment_report.json \
  --report
```

La taxonomie Argumentum cible est la copie in-repo
(`data/argumentum_fallacies_taxonomy.csv`, cf. son NOTICE propre).
